# Removing a found key: the specification's del removes exactly the node's
# entry, and each shape of the node (no left child, no right child, two
# children) gives the unlink and the end of the removal their facts.
# (source: tools/generators/tm_hand/rmd.src)


# the node's entry leaves the entries
